[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-1006","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0207","title":"Unix bing 远程缓冲区溢出任意命令执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0207是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0207"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 bing 至修复该漏洞的最新版本，或通过包管理器完全移除该工具（如 Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt-get purge bing）。如确需使用，应在源码中使用 snprintf 等安全函数替换 strcpy 以修复 gethostbyaddr 缓冲区溢出，并限制仅本地管理员可执行，同时在防火墙禁用外部 ICMP 回显请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0330.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2279","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6036","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/46b010b6722307e014d6f10d53a573bb1f6478ce/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1e8fbb4daef37ec7346b508b9405ee7d135ec28c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0207","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f71e6da69aa54c2303f943ea4b05f52ce2f911ff/2001/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/79f011994331b34296ba6ea2a2efb2abebb8b5f6/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0207.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0207.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0207.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-1000","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-1000.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0203","title":"Watchguard Firebox II 防火墙 权限提升漏洞","description":"Watchguard Firebox II 防火墙存在权限提升漏洞。攻击者通过访问存储有哈希密码短语的文件获取密码哈希值，并在后续认证过程中复用这些哈希值完成身份验证，从而将原本仅具有只读权限的账户提升为具有读写权限及管理员权限。该漏洞影响使用 Watchguard Firebox II 防火墙系统的用户，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用此漏洞，成功利用后可完全控制防火墙设备。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0203"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"由于 Watchguard Firebox II 已停止维护且该漏洞属于严重设计缺陷，建议立即停止使用该型号硬件并升级至当前厂商支持的 Firebox 系列防火墙。在更换硬件前，应通过 ACL 严格限制管理界面的访问权限，防止未经授权的用户访问系统文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0342.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2284","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5979","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/46a996f0289605434908b7f2bee2aa87049865d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0203","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2001/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/d04c47fa1c5351dcfc0e5326362cbbabb6ce30da/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0203.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0203.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0203.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-1000.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0909","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0909.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0181","title":"Caldera Linux DHCP 服务器及客户端 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0181是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0181"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"由于Caldera Linux已停止维护，建议立即迁移至当前受支持的Linux发行版（如Debian、Ubuntu、RHEL等）并安装官方更新。如短期无法迁移，应将ISC DHCP客户端及服务器升级至3.0.1或更高版本以修复错误日志代码中的格式字符串漏洞。同时临时禁用不必要的DHCP服务，并在防火墙中限制UDP 67/68端口的访问来源，仅允许可信内部网络访问，以此作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-003.0.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2215","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5953","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0181","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cb5f9e7ddda132923d86346e273be6f1c71ee410/2001/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0181.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0181.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0181.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0909.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0661","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0661.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0201","title":"Postaci 邮件系统 deletecontact.php SQL注入漏洞","description":"Postaci 是用于 PostgreSQL 数据库的前端 Web 应用程序，其 1.1.2 和 1.1.3 版本中的 deletecontact.php 脚本存在 SQL 注入漏洞。该程序未对用户输入进行充分的字符过滤，未正确过滤分号等特殊字符，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过构造恶意的 SQL 语句作为输入参数提交到 deletecontact.php，从而在数据库层面执行任意 SQL 查询。攻击者利用此漏洞可绕过身份验证、篡改或窃取数据库中的敏感数据，甚至进一步提升权限控制。该漏洞影响范围涵盖使用 Postaci 前端管理 PostgreSQL 数据库的系统，CVSS v3 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高。攻击者只需通过网络向目标系统发送特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发漏洞，利用门槛较低。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0201"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:52Z","remediation":"修复 deletecontact.php 中的 SQL 注入漏洞：对所有用户输入使用 pg_escape_string() 或改用 pg_query_params() 参数化查询，禁止直接将 $_GET/$_POST 变量拼入 SQL 语句。Postaci 项目已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议迁移至仍在维护的 Webmail 系统（如 Roundcube）。临时缓解措施可在 Apache/Nginx 层配置 WAF 规则，拦截对 deletecontact.php 的 SQL 关键字注入请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0287.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2230","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5972","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0201","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e01b8ab6dee830118caf8c9609e7908ef49eeb7/2001/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-02xx/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0201.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0201.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0201.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0661.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0659","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0659.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0195","title":"Debian Linux sash 权限提升漏洞","description":"Debian GNU/Linux 中的 sash（简单 shell）工具在 3.4-4 版本之前存在权限提升漏洞。该程序在处理文件复制时未能正确保护 /etc/shadow 文件的权限，导致其被设置为全局可读（world-readable）。具有低权限的本地攻击者可通过密码破解方式获取系统中的用户哈希凭据，进而提升至高权限并完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 Debian 系统上安装有旧版本 sash 的场景，攻击者需具备本地访问权限才能触发。Debian 已在后续版本中修复此问题，通过确保 /etc/shadow 在克隆过程中保持适当的权限限制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0195"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Debian GNU/Linux 系统中的 sash 软件包升级至 3.4-4 或更高版本，具体操作为：执行 apt-get update && apt-get install sash 完成升级。升级后需验证 /etc/shadow 文件权限为 640（属主 root 可读写、组 shadow 可读），执行 ls -l /etc/shadow 确认。如暂无法升级，应临时禁用普通用户对 sash 的 SUID 执行权限，执行 chmod 0755 $(which sash) 或通过 dpkg --purge sash 移除该软件包以消除风险。升级完成后建议审计系统密码文件访问记录，排查是否存在历史未授权读取行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-015","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0195","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1df391c77d130b035c18b078a1d93cfdac5c26df/2001/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0195.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0195.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0195.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0659.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0658","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0658.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0190","title":"Sun Solaris cu 本地缓冲区溢出权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Solaris 2.8 及更早版本中的 /usr/bin/cu 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过执行 cu 时传入超长的程序名称（arg0）参数触发该溢出，从而在本地提升自身权限。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Solaris 的系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可利用此漏洞获取更高权限，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0190"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"升级至 Solaris 9 或更高版本，从根本上修复 /usr/bin/cu 的缓冲区溢出漏洞。若无法升级，Solaris 2.6 系统应安装补丁 106468-02，Solaris 7 系统应安装补丁 108372-01。临时缓解措施：通过 chmod 750 /usr/bin/cu 并仅授予 root 组执行权限，或通过 sudoers 限制普通用户执行 cu，避免未授权本地用户利用长程序名参数触发特权提升。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97983943716311&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98028642319440&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6224","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0190","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0190.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0190.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0190.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0658.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0657","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0657.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0188","title":"GoodTech FTP Server 连接洪泛拒绝服务漏洞","description":"GoodTech FTP Server 3.0.1.2.1.0 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 FTP 服务发起大量并发连接请求，服务器在处理海量连接时资源耗尽导致崩溃。该漏洞影响运行 GoodTech FTP Server 的各类服务器系统，攻击者利用脚本工具持续建立连接即可触发服务中断，造成合法用户无法正常访问 FTP 服务，影响业务可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0188"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"升级至 GoodTech FTP Server 修复版本或更高版本，彻底消除连接洪水漏洞。若短期内无法升级，应在防火墙上对 FTP 端口（TCP 21）实施单 IP 最大并发连接数限制（如 iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 21 -m connlimit --connlimit-above 3 -j REJECT），并在服务器端启用连接超时与空闲会话回收，降低被洪水攻击导致崩溃的风险。长期建议迁移至 ProFTPD、vsftpd 等持续维护的 FTP 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0350.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2270","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5984","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0188","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2001/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0188.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0188.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0188.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0657.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0655","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0655.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0185","title":"Netopia R9100 路由器 Telnet 客户端拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0185是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0185"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:50Z","remediation":"标签之间。<value>升级Netopia R9100路由器固件至厂商提供的最高可用版本，或联系技术支持获取安全补丁。如无法立即升级，建议在路由器管理界面禁用Telnet远程管理服务，改用SSH（若设备支持），并在防火墙或访问控制列表中仅允许受信任的网段访问23/Telnet端口，阻止外部攻击者通过Telnet连接触发服务崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/157952","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2287","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6001","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0185","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/092113bf9ab92144574ec15fc26608ac15913e5a/2001/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6450d916b228b26926c778e450e50985a2beb640/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0185.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0185.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0185.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0655.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0654","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0654.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0182","title":"Check Point FireWall-1 4.1 IP 报文拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 4.1 版本在使用受限 IP 许可证时存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可向内部接口发送大量伪造源地址的 IP 数据包，导致控制台被警告消息淹没并耗尽 CPU 资源，使防火墙无法正常处理合法流量。该漏洞影响 FireWall-1 4.1 受限许可证版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，仅需能向防火墙内部接口发送数据包即可触发，属于资源耗尽型拒绝服务攻击，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），主要影响可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0182"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Check Point Firewall-1 4.1 SP1 或更高版本（如 NG AI R55），该版本修复了有限 IP 许可下的欺骗包处理逻辑。若暂时无法升级，可在内部接口配置反欺骗规则：启用 \"Anti-Spoofing\" 并设置为 \"Track\" 或 \"Prevent\" 模式，限制源地址为合法内网网段；同时在管理控制台调高 \"Log Alerts\" 阈值或禁用针对此类欺骗包的控制台告警，防止日志泛滥耗尽 CPU 资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0298.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1733","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2238","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5966","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0182","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7e7ff27a2a43d6a76e9c2a314d1074b5484220ae/2001/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/6d2a191f97c65ab76ada9b714aa0a4ddb4f2dd4c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0182.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0182.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0182.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0654.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0652","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0652.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0178","title":"KDE2 kdesu 本地密码泄露和权限提升漏洞","description":"KDE2 桌面环境中的 kdesu 程序在通过 UNIX socket 传输用户密码时，未对 socket 的所有者身份进行正确验证。攻击者可利用此缺陷在本地窃取其他用户的密码，进而提升自身权限。该漏洞影响 KDE 2.2.0-6 及之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 2.1。由于漏洞仅能被本地用户利用，因此危害程度有限，KDE 已在后续版本中修复了此问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0178"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 至 2.2.0-6 或更高版本以修复 kdesu UNIX Socket 验证缺陷。若暂时无法升级，可通过设置 kdesu 文件权限为 700（仅所有者可执行）或使用 sudo 替代 kdesu 进行提权操作作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-005.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-018.php3?dis=7.2","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_002_kdesu_txt.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5995","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0178","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2001/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0178.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0178.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0178.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0652.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0651","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0651.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0176","title":"Voyant Sonata setuid doroot程序本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Voyant Sonata 3.x 中的 setuid 程序 doroot 存在本地权限提升漏洞。该程序以 set-user-id(setuid) 权限运行，但在执行用户提供的命令行参数时缺乏严格的权限校验与安全校验，导致普通本地用户能够滥用该程序将任意命令以参数形式传入运行，从而以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现从普通用户到系统最高权限的权限提升。攻击者只需具备系统本地账户且可交互执行该程序即可触发，无需其他认证条件。该漏洞影响范围较大，一旦成功利用，攻击者可完全控制受影响的主机系统，造成机密性、完整性与可用性的全面丧失。根据 CVSS 评分 7.2（向量 AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），该漏洞被评定为高危级别。官方建议限制 doroot 程序的执行权限或将其移除，并尽早升级到修复了该问题的版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0176"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:49Z","remediation":"立即升级到厂商提供的修复版本，或直接删除/移除以 root 权限运行的 setuid `doroot` 程序并撤销其 SUID 位（执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/doroot`），切断本地用户以 root 执行任意命令的提权通道。在无法立即修复时，应限制本地非授权用户对受影响主机的登录访问，并审查 `doroot` 的可执行权限与归属，确保仅有受信管理员可调用；同时审计系统日志中是否已有利用该程序的提权痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0278.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2125","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5787","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0176","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edbeec8f0d16e85a3e6ef588978e47a49091e51a/2001/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0176.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0176.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0176.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0651.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0650","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0650.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0175","title":"Netscape Fasttrack Server 4.1 缓存模块拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netscape Fasttrack Server 4.1 的缓存模块存在资源消耗型拒绝服务漏洞。远攻击者无需身份认证，通过网络可达即可触发，攻击条件为可向目标服务器持续发送大量不存在的 URL 请求。由于缓存模块会对每个未命中项进行资源分配与缓存处理，大量的无效 URL 请求将导致服务器内存等缓存资源被迅速耗尽，进而使服务器无法正常处理合法用户的访问请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响面为运行 Netscape Fasttrack Server 4.1 的所有平台，危害等级中危（CVSS 5.0），攻击者仅需构造大量恶意请求即可实施拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0175"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:48Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于缓存模块对大量不存在 URL（如 .html）的请求进行缓存且不及时释放，导致服务器内存被耗尽、响应迟缓。厂商已明确回复 Fasttrack Server 不适用于生产环境，且不会修复此问题，因此**无官方补丁可用**。强烈建议立即停用该产品，迁移至受支持的 iPlanet/Netscape Enterprise Server 4.1 SP5 或后续维护的 Web 服务器（如 Sun Java System Web Server），并设置合理的缓存上限与缓存回收策略。如无法立即迁移，应在前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx）并开启请求速率限制，同时在防火墙或路由器上配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许可信来源 IP 访问该服务，将其限制在内网隔离区，以降低被利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98021351718874&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98035833331446&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2273","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5985","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0175","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/edbeec8f0d16e85a3e6ef588978e47a49091e51a/2001/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0175.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0175.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0175.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0650.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0648","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0648.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0166","title":"Macromedia Shockwave Flash 插件 SWF 文件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Macromedia Shockwave Flash 插件 8.0 及更早版本在处理 SWF 文件时存在拒绝服务漏洞。漏洞原理在于插件在解析 SWF 文件标签结构时未对标签长度字段进行严格校验，攻击者可通过构造包含异常标签长度字段的特制 SWF 文件，触发解析器处理异常导致进程崩溃。攻击条件要求目标用户访问嵌有恶意 SWF 内容的网页或直接打开恶意 SWF 文件，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程实施。受影响范围包括所有使用 Macromedia Shockwave Flash Plugin 8.0 及以下版本的系统和浏览器，成功利用可导致浏览器或插件进程异常终止，造成服务拒绝。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0166"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-03-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:47Z","remediation":"立即升级 Macromedia Flash Player 至 9.0 或更高版本以修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Flash Player 已于 2020 年 12 月终止支持，建议直接从浏览器和操作系统中卸载或禁用该插件，并避免打开来源不明的 SWF 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0491.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5826","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c77fff35609ce3594a3cffb2b3b0994cbb03c5f2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0166.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2e34647e2cb70f634f637d7ffe35fe3375a62e16/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0166.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0166","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0166.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0166.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-01xx/CVE-2001-0166.json","https://github.com/opencve/